  "name": "9T SRAM Cell — Low-Leakage with Sleep Transistor",
  "description": "9-transistor SRAM cell that adds a sleep/power-gating NMOS (M_SLP) to the pull-down network of each inverter half. During standby, M_SLP is turned OFF, completely cutting the subthreshold leakage path to GND. Ideal for near-threshold / IoT applications where leakage is the dominant power component.",
  "category": "Memory",
  "technology": ["SKY130"],
  "keywords": ["9t sram", "9t", "9 transistor sram", "sleep transistor sram", "power gated sram", "low leakage sram", "sram 9t"],
